'''Oily''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It’s blade is maroon in color with an oily-looking texture, hence the name. On the blade are these swirls of colors, giving it the oily look. The guard is gold, and the handle is solid black.

